title = "The Warden's Ledger, v"
text = "I set the Great Sluice on a weigh pan and gave it two live weights that would never keep still. Then I drowned the Tide Bell in its well, so the Hush would not hear it ring. If you are reading this, hold them still and ring it. Let it hear."

